<title>USA: Group lifts MC Shipping stake to 7.49 pct.</title>
<headline>Group lifts MC Shipping stake to 7.49 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Perkins Capital Advisers Inc said Tuesday it raised its stake in MC Shipping Inc to 7.49 percent or 458,359 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 122,900 additional shares of MC Shipping between June 9 to August 28 at prices ranging from $3.42 to $4.00 a share.</p>
<p>At mid-morning Tuesday, shares were up 1/8 at 4.</p>
